\b Task Tracker Fullstack - Daily Execution Print Checklist\b0\par
Version: 2026-06-10\par
\par
\b How to Use This Sheet (Every Day)\b0\par
1) Read the day section fully before starting.\par
2) Execute tasks in listed order.\par
3) Log proof in evidence log (for build/validation days).\par
4) Run Day Completion Gate before marking done.\par
5) Update roadmap/checklist only after checks pass.\par
\par
\b Standard End-of-Day Definition (All Days)\b0\par
- Planned tasks complete or explicitly deferred with reason.\par
- Required validation executed.\par
- Evidence/documentation updated.\par
- Git clean and synced (unless explicitly documented exception).\par
\par
\b Day 1 - Plan and Setup\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Create repo and local project folder.\par
- Create folders: frontend, backend, docs, infra.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add README with goal and MVP scope.\par
- Add planning docs: project-plan, project-architecture, api-contract.\par
- Initialize git, commit baseline, push to main.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Repo structure exists and README is committed.\par
\par
\b Day 2 - Backend Scaffold\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Create FastAPI entrypoint.\par
- Add GET /health endpoint.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add config loading in backend/app/core/config.py.\par
- Start backend and verify /health response.\par
- Update setup/troubleshooting docs with actual commands.\par
Day complete when:\par
- GET /health returns status ok in development.\par
\par
\b Day 3 - Database + CRUD\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Start Postgres container.\par
- Apply latest Alembic migration.\par
Then do this:\par
- Verify task CRUD end-to-end (create/list/get/update/delete/get-after-delete).\par
- Run day3 smoke test script.\par
- Record evidence in day-3-evidence-log.md.\par
Day complete when:\par
- CRUD works against Postgres and smoke test passes.\par
\par
\b Day 4 - Authentication\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Implement users table/model and register endpoint.\par
Then do this:\par
- Implement login endpoint with JWT token.\par
- Protect task routes with auth dependency and ownership checks.\par
- Run auth smoke checks (register/login/auth required/ownership behavior).\par
- Record results in day-4-evidence-log.md.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Register/login/protected routes behave correctly (401/409 paths included).\par
\par
\b Day 5 - API Quality\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Validate request schemas and status codes.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add pagination support.\par
- Add filtering/search support.\par
- Validate error format consistency.\par
- Record proof in day-5-evidence-log.md.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Validation, pagination, and filtering all verified.\par
\par
\b Day 6 - Frontend Scaffold\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Create React + TypeScript app.\par
- Install react-router-dom and axios.\par
- Create folder structure: components/pages/services/hooks.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add routes: /login, /register, /tasks, /tasks/:id.\par
- Build base layout (header/sidebar/main).\par
- Create login and register forms with validation.\par
- Call backend auth endpoints and store JWT in localStorage.\par
- Redirect to /tasks on success and show errors on failure.\par
- Add GA4 page_view, user_registered, user_login events.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Frontend runs, auth pages render, login/register works with backend.\par
\par
\b Day 7 - Task UI + API Integration\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Build task list UI and fetch tasks with auth header.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add filters/search/pagination controls.\par
- Add create/edit task forms and validation.\par
- Add delete with confirmation.\par
- Implement loading/empty/error/success states.\par
- Add GA4 events: task_created/task_updated/task_deleted/task_completed.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Full task CRUD works from browser with all states covered.\par
\par
\b Day 8 - UX Polish\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Add skeleton and spinner UX.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add empty and error states for major flows.\par
- Add protected route behavior and logout flow.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Loading/empty/error/success states are all visible and correct.\par
\par
\b Day 9 - Dockerize Services\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Create backend and frontend Dockerfiles.\par
Then do this:\par
- Create compose for backend/frontend/postgres with volume and envs.\par
- Run full stack with docker compose up --build.\par
- Validate health endpoint and CRUD via containerized app.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Full stack runs via Docker and works after clean reclone test.\par
\par
\b Day 10 - Reliability\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Add .env.example and verify .gitignore policy.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add persistence and health checks to compose setup.\par
- Validate restart persistence.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Fresh clone startup and restart persistence both pass.\par
\par
\b Day 11 - Automated Testing\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Implement backend tests for auth and task behavior.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add frontend tests for task list/form/login behavior.\par
- Run pytest and frontend test command.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Backend and frontend test suites pass.\par
\par
\b Day 12 - CI/CD (GitHub Actions)\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Create CI workflow file.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add backend and frontend test jobs.\par
- Add optional lint job and badge update.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Push triggers CI and all checks pass with green badge.\par
\par
\b Day 13 - Deployment\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Deploy backend and set environment variables.\par
Then do this:\par
- Run migrations in deployed environment.\par
- Deploy frontend and verify live health + CRUD.\par
- Verify GA4 events in production.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Live URL works and key features pass in prod.\par
\par
\b Day 14 - Portfolio Packaging\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Finalize README with visuals/badges/quick start.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add ADRs, Postman collection, CONTRIBUTING.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Recruiter can understand quickly and developer can run quickly.\par
\par
\b Day 15 - AI Parse (Backend)\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Add OpenAI package and API key support.\par
Then do this:\par
- Build parse endpoint and robust error handling.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Natural language parse works and error/no-auth cases are correct.\par
\par
\b Day 16 - AI Parse (Frontend)\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Build AI input component and hook.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add mode toggle and editable preview before create.\par
Day complete when:\par
- User can parse then edit then create task.\par
\par
\b Day 17 - AI Suggestions\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Build suggestions endpoint and prompt logic.\par
Then do this:\par
- Build suggestion UI and caching.\par
- Add GA4 suggestion events.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Suggestions render and refresh behavior is correct.\par
\par
\b Day 18 - AI Polish\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Improve AI state handling and loading UX.\par
Then do this:\par
- Cover edge cases and timeout behavior.\par
- Verify GA4 real-time events.\par
Day complete when:\par
- AI success/failure/loading/empty/rate-limit states all work.\par
\par
\b Day 19 - AI Docs + Tests + Deploy\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Update README/ADR/Postman for AI features.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add AI backend/frontend tests and redeploy.\par
- Validate AI on live environment.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Live AI flows work and tests pass in CI.\par
\par
\b Day 20-21 - Portfolio Site Update\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Update project card/skills/contact links/resume availability.\par
Then do this:\par
- Ensure GA4 tracking active on portfolio.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Portfolio clearly presents project and links are functional.\par
\par
\b Day 22 - Subdomain Setup\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Configure DNS CNAME and Vercel custom domain.\par
Then do this:\par
- Verify SSL and mobile behavior for both domains.\par
Day complete when:\par
- app subdomain and root domain both resolve correctly.\par
\par
\b Day 23 - Resume Update\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Add project bullets and updated skills.\par
Then do this:\par
- Add portfolio/GitHub links and validate PDF export.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Resume is updated and downloadable as correct PDF.\par
\par
\b Day 24-25 - Video Walkthrough\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Record 3-5 minute walkthrough using script outline.\par
Then do this:\par
- Upload and add link to README + portfolio.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Video is published and linked in both places.\par
\par
\b Day 26 - Blog + Lighthouse\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Publish technical blog post.\par
Then do this:\par
- Run lighthouse audit, capture screenshots, add to README.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Blog link and lighthouse section are present.\par
\par
\b Day 27 - Final Review\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Validate must-have list (live app, tests, README, reliability).\par
Then do this:\par
- Validate should-have and nice-to-have items.\par
- Run full system test list end-to-end.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Must-have criteria are all satisfied and verified.\par
\par
\b Day 28+ - Apply\b0\par
Do this first:\par
- Prepare application package (resume/portfolio/github/video/blog links).\par
Then do this:\par
- Update LinkedIn headline and featured section.\par
Day complete when:\par
- Application-ready package is reusable for each job application.\par
