- Secure authentication and authorization with JWT, including protected task ownership behavior.\par
- Complete task management experience: create, read, update, delete, filtering, search, pagination, and reliable error states.\par
- Verified quality controls: smoke tests, automated tests, CI pipeline, and documented evidence logs for completed milestones.\par
